      "title": "Tiered Cache Absorption",
      "items": [
        "High-throughput NVMe/SSD cache tier absorbs all synchronous writes",
        "category.create=ff policy ensures sub-millisecond local latency",
        "POSIX-compliant transparent union prevents application re-architecting"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Zero-Knowledge Cryptography",
      "items": [
        "Client-side AES-256-GCM cipher guarantees zero-knowledge offloading",
        "File data, directory structures, and metadata strictly encrypted prior to egress",
        "Seamless multi-backend pooling across S3, Google Drive, and B2 via rclone union"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Fault-Tolerant Engine",
      "items": [
        "Autonomous watchdog daemon detects hung FUSE mounts via timed I/O probes",
        "Automatic unmount and restart cycle eliminates silent storage stalls",
        "Debounced, rate-limited alerting (<5/min) delivers actionable telemetry"
      ]
